### IDTS-6 Happy Flow Manual Test
### Requirements: Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code (humao.rest-client)
### Setup: Run `npx cds watch` in your terminal first.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/bug
# CAP mock auth uses basic auth: alice / alice
@auth = Basic YWxpY2U6YWxpY2U=

# IDs for testing
@bugIdNew = 90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bugIdInProgress = 90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@developerSangVN = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@developerDatDT = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### 1. View all bugs
GET {{baseUrl}}/Bugs
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 2. SC-01: Create a new Bug (Draft/Active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Bugs
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manual QA Test Bug",
  "description": "Created via REST Client",
  "stepsToReproduce": "1. Run request",
  "actualResult": "Bug created",
  "expectedResult": "Success",
  "priority_code": "HIGH",
  "severity_code": "MAJOR",
  "environment_code": "QAS",
  "applicationComponent_ID": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "defectCategory_ID": "50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "reporter_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004"
}

### 3. SC-02: Assign Bug to DatDT (using ID BUG1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Bugs(ID={{bugIdNew}},IsActiveEntity=true)/BugService.assignToDeveloper
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeID": "{{developerDatDT}}",
  "note": "Assigned manually via VS Code"
}

### 4. SC-03: Mark In Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/Bugs(ID={{bugIdNew}},IsActiveEntity=true)/BugService.markInReview
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. SC-08: Resolve Bug (Testing IDTS-3 Fix with BUG3)
# -> EXPECT 400 ERROR (Missing note)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Bugs(ID={{bugIdInProgress}},IsActiveEntity=true)/BugService.resolveBug
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": ""
}

### 6. SC-08: Resolve Bug (Valid note)
# -> EXPECT 200 SUCCESS
POST {{baseUrl}}/Bugs(ID={{bugIdInProgress}},IsActiveEntity=true)/BugService.resolveBug
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Fixed root cause during manual test"
}

### 7. View History Logs for BUG3
GET {{baseUrl}}/HistoryLogs?$filter=bug_ID eq {{bugIdInProgress}}&$orderby=createdAt desc
Authorization: {{auth}}
